    "body": "Well, I've confirmed at least that manually running @ForbesLindesay's test case from the OP of https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2796 works the same in Firefox as in Chrome (URL updates to `#cat`). So I guess it is a different issue; in fact the assert message is pretty helpful, and reveals that history.back() doesn't seem to be async in Firefox.\r\n\r\nWhich is all to say, maybe there is a simpler test that passes in all browsers and still tests the issue here, that we can extract out of @ForbesLindesay's test case.",
